The '''Oasis Rabbit''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Sea Creature]] that spawns while fishing in the {{Zone|Oasis}} after reaching {{Skill|Fishing|10}}. They act like normal [[Rabbit]]s, but will shoot the player with arrows if it has not been damaged in a while.

Bringing one to {{NPCSprite|Jake}} will allow the player to purchase the {{Item|Lucky Dice}}.

== Spawning ==
An '''Oasis Rabbit''' can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Oasis}} with a water [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]] if the player has {{Skill|fishing|10}}.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Oasis Rabbit''' is {{Green|300}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|5.66%|1|17.65|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
